## Summary

Production deployment framework for kotoba migration (Merkle-LSM database system, strangler-fig fleet migration) is COMPLETE and FULLY ACTIVATED as of 2026-07-21. All technical work for M1–M6, Wave 1–5, and security gates is finalized. Deployment timeline is locked through production cutover (2026-09-14 target).

## Context

Kotoba migration is a complete rewrite of the Merkle-LSM database from Rust to Clojure, introducing Signal protocol cryptography for fleet encryption and executing a strangler-fig pattern to replace legacy infrastructure. This ADR documents the final execution phase completion (24-hour intensive parallel work across 4 phases, 13 agents).

## Decision

